Codegen: a single tuple context manager needs double parentheses (`with ((a, b)):`).
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-codegen-with-tuple.py (ruff_parse_idempotency).

diff --git a/crates/ruff_python_codegen/src/generator.rs b/crates/ruff_python_codegen/src/generator.rs
